## 🎯 Key Points You Can Write in Exam

- DFS uses **stack** (explicitly or implicitly via recursion)
- Always go **deep** before going sideways
- Excellent for:
  ✔ Topological sorting  
  ✔ Solving mazes  
  ✔ Checking connectivity  

